{
    "id":  26817,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Garden Bollard AERO 12W 3CCT Round Adjustable 310° SMD3030 Osram IP65",
    "reference":  "RWLB12W-92258",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eLED Garden Bollard \u003cstrong\u003eAERO 12W 3CCT\u003c/strong\u003e, adjustable \u003cstrong\u003e310°\u003c/strong\u003e, with \u003cstrong\u003eSMD3030 Osram\u003c/strong\u003e chip and \u003cstrong\u003eEagleRise Driver\u003c/strong\u003e, designed for outdoor and indoor lighting. Selectable \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K and 6000K\u003c/strong\u003e, with \u003cstrong\u003e110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e and a \u003cstrong\u003e120°\u003c/strong\u003e beam angle for uniform illumination. Includes an \u003cstrong\u003e800 mm AERO post\u003c/strong\u003e, made of matte black aluminium with a frosted glass diffuser and an \u003cstrong\u003eIP67 waterproof connector\u003c/strong\u003e. A durable, modern and versatile solution for gardens, pathways, terraces and landscaped areas.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Garden Bollard AERO 12W | 3CCT | IP65\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eLED Garden Bollard AERO 12W\u003c/strong\u003e combines an \u003cstrong\u003eadjustable AERO LED wall light\u003c/strong\u003e with an \u003cstrong\u003e800 mm aluminium post\u003c/strong\u003e, creating a complete solution for decorative and functional outdoor lighting in gardens, pathways, terraces and landscaped areas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe light fitting features an \u003cstrong\u003eSMD3030 Osram chip\u003c/strong\u003e and an \u003cstrong\u003eEagleRise Driver\u003c/strong\u003e, delivering \u003cstrong\u003e110 lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e efficiency and uniform illumination thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003e120° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e. Its \u003cstrong\u003eselectable 3CCT\u003c/strong\u003e system lets you choose between \u003cstrong\u003e3000K, 4000K and 6000K\u003c/strong\u003e, adapting the colour temperature to each space.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts round design allows \u003cstrong\u003eadjustment of up to 310°\u003c/strong\u003e to direct the light exactly where it is needed. It is made of \u003cstrong\u003ematte black aluminium\u003c/strong\u003e with a \u003cstrong\u003efrosted glass diffuser\u003c/strong\u003e, combining durability with a modern look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe set includes an \u003cstrong\u003e800 mm high AERO aluminium post\u003c/strong\u003e and an \u003cstrong\u003eIP67 waterproof connector\u003c/strong\u003e, providing a solution suitable for outdoor installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMain features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePower:\u003c/strong\u003e 12W\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLED chip:\u003c/strong\u003e SMD3030 Osram\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDriver:\u003c/strong\u003e EagleRise\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEfficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e 110 lm/W\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColour temperature:\u003c/strong\u003e 3CCT – 3000K / 4000K / 6000K\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBeam angle:\u003c/strong\u003e 120°\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdjustment:\u003c/strong\u003e 310°\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight fitting protection:\u003c/strong\u003e IP65\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial:\u003c/strong\u003e Aluminium\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFinish:\u003c/strong\u003e Matte black\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDiffuser:\u003c/strong\u003e Frosted glass\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePost:\u003c/strong\u003e Aluminium, \u003cstrong\u003e800 mm\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnector:\u003c/strong\u003e Waterproof \u003cstrong\u003eIP67\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupply\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe solution consists of \u003cstrong\u003etwo separate products: the AERO LED wall light and the 800 mm aluminium post\u003c/strong\u003e. Both are \u003cstrong\u003esupplied separately and unassembled\u003c/strong\u003e, allowing assembly during installation according to the needs of the project.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eUses and applications\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for \u003cstrong\u003egardens, pathways, terraces, patios, entrances and landscaped areas\u003c/strong\u003e, in residential, commercial and landscaping projects alike.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eAERO Bollard\u003c/strong\u003e creates low-level lighting points with a \u003cstrong\u003e310° adjustable\u003c/strong\u003e luminaire, 3 selectable colour temperatures and an aluminium support designed specifically for this series.\u003c/p\u003e",
